---
// One illustrative full-path run, played line by line (see scripts/run-reveal.ts).
---

<section id="run" class="border-t border-phi-rule py-20 md:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-10">
      <p class="label text-phi-muted flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-5">
        <span class="w-[7px] h-[7px] rounded-full bg-phi-red"></span>
        <span>Example run · Full path</span>
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-serif font-light text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-[52px] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.025em] text-phi-head mb-4">
        One run, start to finish.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-phi-text">
        A feature request goes down the full path: a question, a plan, three tasks in their own worktree, and a review. An illustrative run, shortened. Real runs print more.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="run-terminal rounded-xl bg-phi-panel border border-phi-rule font-mono text-xs md:text-[13px] text-phi-text overflow-hidden">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-phi-rule label text-phi-muted">
        <span class="normal-case tracking-normal">phil · calc @ main</span>
        <span>illustrative</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 md:p-6 space-y-2.5 overflow-x-auto">
        <div data-run-line class="flex gap-2">
          <span class="text-phi-yellow">›</span>
          <span class="text-phi-head">add a --json flag to calc history</span>
        </div>
        <div data-run-line class="text-phi-red">
          ● routed: full path <span class="text-phi-muted">· Jev, confidence 0.93 · 160 ms</span>
        </div>
        <div data-run-line>
          <span class="text-phi-yellow">?</span> Should --json print one array, or one object per line?
          <span class="text-phi-head">› one array</span>
        </div>
        <div data-run-line>
          <span class="text-phi-yellow">?</span> Two ways to build it: a formatter module, or a flag inside the command.
          <span class="text-phi-head">› a formatter module</span>
        </div>
        <div data-run-line>
          <span class="text-phi-head">architect</span> <span class="text-phi-muted">(high)</span> wrote a spec and a plan: 3 tasks
        </div>
        <div data-run-line>
          <span class="text-phi-head">critic</span> <span class="text-phi-muted">(high)</span> approved the plan
        </div>
        <div data-run-line class="text-phi-muted">
          worktree <span class="text-phi-text">.phil/worktrees/r-7c2a</span> on branch phil/r-7c2a
        </div>
        <div data-run-line class="pl-3 border-l border-phi-rule text-phi-muted">
          task 1/3 <span class="text-phi-text">the JSON formatter</span> · implementer (low) · <span class="text-phi-head">tests pass</span>
        </div>
        <div data-run-line class="pl-3 border-l border-phi-rule text-phi-muted">
          task 2/3 <span class="text-phi-text">the --json flag</span> · implementer (low) · <span class="text-phi-head">tests pass</span>
        </div>
        <div data-run-line class="pl-3 border-l border-phi-rule text-phi-muted">
          task 3/3 <span class="text-phi-text">the docs</span> · implementer (low) · <span class="text-phi-head">checks pass</span>
        </div>
        <div data-run-line>
          <span class="text-phi-head">reviewer</span> <span class="text-phi-muted">(high)</span> 0 open issues
        </div>
        <div data-run-line class="pt-3 border-t border-phi-rule text-phi-head">
          ✓ branch ready · phil pr r-7c2a <span class="text-phi-muted">· run cost $0.31</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { startRunReveal } from "../scripts/run-reveal";

  const run = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(".run-terminal");
  if (run) startRunReveal(run);
</script>

<style>
  [data-run-line] {
    transition: opacity 0.35s ease-out;
  }

  :global(.is-pending) {
    opacity: 0;
  }
</style>
